.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrlen(const char *" s ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrlen()
function returns the number of characters in the null-terminated
string
.I s
, not counting the terminating null byte.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the length of the string as an integer.
.SH AUTHOR
